What this means for you
-----------------------

NonCommercial. You may use, copy and redistribute this directory's content for
non-commercial purposes. Commercial use — including using these specific skills
on a paid engagement — requires prior approval from CIS. Contact CIS if you need
a commercial license.

ShareAlike. If you remix or build upon this content, you must distribute your
contributions under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

Attribution. Keep this notice, credit CIS, and link the license.

The rest of BountyReper is MIT licensed and carries none of these restrictions.
Deleting this directory removes them entirely — nothing in the codebase depends
on it, and no entry in ../index.json references it.
